{
  "title": "allow 写域名的下场：nginx -t 直接报错（实拍）",
  "lines": [
    {"t": "config", "s": "allow yourwebsite.com;  deny all;"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "nginx -t"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "nginx: [emerg] invalid parameter \"yourwebsite.com\""},
    {"t": "out", "s": "nginx: configuration file ... test failed"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "allow/deny 只收 IP/CIDR，域名匹配是 valid_referers 的活"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "改配置后先 nginx -t，报错即止不做 reload"}
  ]
}
